@startuml KTOB_04_components
title KTOB - Logical Components (one Java deployable)
skinparam componentStyle uml2
actor Reader
component "Angular SPA [Vercel]" as Web
node "Spring Boot runtime [Render]" {
 component "REST API + authorization" as API
 component "Reader / Privacy / Export" as ReaderModule
 component "Library / Journal / Collections" as LibraryModule
 component "Catalog" as CatalogModule
 component "Literary Advisor" as AdvisorModule
 component "Acquisition" as AcqModule
 component "Provider adapters" as Adapters
}
database "Supabase Postgres [private app schema]" as DB
component "Supabase Auth [EXT]" as Auth
component "Open Library [EXT]" as OL
component "AI provider [PROPOSED]" as AI
component "Seller source [BLOCKED]" as Sellers
Reader --> Web
Web --> API : HTTPS / JSON
Web --> Auth : sign in
API --> ReaderModule
API --> LibraryModule
API --> CatalogModule
API --> AdvisorModule
API --> AcqModule
ReaderModule --> Auth : verify token
ReaderModule --> DB : owner-only queries / export
LibraryModule --> DB
CatalogModule --> DB
AdvisorModule --> DB
AcqModule --> DB
CatalogModule --> Adapters : work metadata
AdvisorModule --> Adapters : AI after consent gate
AcqModule --> Adapters : seller lookup
Adapters --> OL
Adapters --> AI
Adapters ..> Sellers : unconfigured
note right of API
One modular JVM, NOT network microservices.
REST is provisional pending course rubric.
end note
@enduml
